WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
The second category is clarity and
understanding.

2
00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:08.540
Transparency is the strict requirement for
absolute clarity regarding how data

3
00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:11.760
is processed and how algorithmic decisions
are made.

4
00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:16.080
Explainability is the distinct requirement
that AI predictions must be

5
00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:19.940
structurally comprehensible to the
stakeholders and clinicians actually using

6
00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:21.096
the system. actual
